    "Condition : 1 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the reports, specifications and drawings detailed PP-14286956v1, A08.03 Rev A0\r\nReason: To ensure a satisfactory standard of development and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme. \r\n",
